    {
      "group": "672191",
      "task": "672191",
      "context": {
        "problem_id": "b7c94dee-c5aa-411b-9533-da8adb71ad3f",
        "transformations": {
          "schema_version": 3,
          "revision": 11,
          "items": [
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T13:20:00.284399+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Ре­ши­те урав­не­ние:  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{12\\sin x-\\frac{9}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{17}{2}}=\\frac{9}{8}+4\\sin x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos^{2} x\"></span>. </li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Най­ди­те все корни урав­не­ния, при­над­ле­жа­щие от­рез­ку  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{\\pi}{2};\\pi]\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Условие",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T13:20:00.284399+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<p>а)  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\{\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k,\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\mid k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\\}\"></span> ;  б)   <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </p>",
                "title": "Ответ",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T13:20:00.284399+00:00",
              "by": {
                "type": "pipeline",
                "stage": "deterministic_svg"
              },
              "value": {
                "html": "<ol data-layout=\"source-subparts\" type=\"a\"><li data-list-marker=\"а)\">Пре­об­ра­зу­ем урав­не­ние:<p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sqrt{12\\sin x-\\frac{9}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{17}{2}}=\\frac{9}{8}+4\\sin x+\\frac{1}{2}\\cos^{2} x\\iff \\sqrt{9\\sin^{2} x+12\\sin x+4}=\\frac{13}{8}+4\\sin x-\\frac{1}{2}\\sin^{2} x\\iff \\left|3\\sin x+2\\right|=\\frac{13}{8}+4\\sin x-\\frac{1}{2}\\sin^{2} x\"></span>. </span></p><p>Сде­ла­ем за­ме­ну пе­ре­мен­ной <span data-inline-latex=\"t=\\sin x\"></span>, по­лу­чим:</p><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"\\begin{cases}|3t+2|=\\frac{13}{8}+4t-\\frac{1}{2}t^2,\\\\|t|\\le 1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}3t+2&amp;=\\frac{13}{8}+4t-\\frac{1}{2}t^2,\\\\3t+2&amp;=-\\frac{13}{8}-4t+\\frac{1}{2}t^2,\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\\\frac{13}{8}+4t-\\frac{1}{2}t^2&amp;\\ge 0,\\\\|t|&amp;\\le 1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}4t^2-8t+3&amp;=0,\\\\4t^2-56t-29&amp;=0,\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\4t^2-32t-13&amp;\\le 0,\\\\|t|&amp;\\le 1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}\\left[\\begin{aligned}t&amp;=\\frac{1}{2},\\\\t&amp;=\\frac{3}{2},\\\\t&amp;=-\\frac{1}{2},\\\\t&amp;=\\frac{29}{2},\n\\end{aligned}\\right.\\\\4t^2-32t-13&amp;\\le 0,\\\\|t|&amp;\\le 1\\end{cases}\\Leftrightarrow t=\\frac{1}{2}\"></span></span></p><p>Вер­нем­ся к ис­ход­ной пе­ре­мен­ной: </p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\sin x=\\frac{1}{2}\\iff \\left[\\begin{aligned}x=\\frac{\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\\\x=\\frac{5\\pi}{6}+2\\pi k\\end{aligned}\\right..k\\in\\mathbb{Z}\"></span> . </p></center></li><li data-list-marker=\"б)\">Длина от­рез­ка  <span data-inline-latex=\"[-\\frac{\\pi}{2};\\pi]\"></span>  мень­ше 2π, а рас­сто­я­ние между со­сед­ни­ми чле­на­ми в най­ден­ных се­ри­ях равно 2π. Сле­до­ва­тель­но, из каж­дой серии на от­рез­ке может ле­жать не более од­но­го члена. Оче­вид­но, что под­хо­дят ре­ше­ния, со­от­вет­ству­ю­щие <i>k</i> = 0, это числа  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{\\pi}{6}\"></span>  и  <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{5\\pi}{6}\"></span> . </li></ol>",
                "title": "Решение",
                "asset_keys": []
              },
              "operation": "rewrite",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            },
            {
              "at": "2026-10-02T13:20:00.284399+00:00",
